            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Robbie Rice"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Anytime I go out for a drink, I order Bahama Mamas. I am also a bartender. Coffee-flavored liqueur IS NOT in any Bahama Mama I've ever had. Try using light rum (or 151), coconut rum, banana liqueur, orange juice, pineapple juice, and grenadine."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kellieann"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was ok but it didn't taste like the bahama mama I'm used to. What I'm used to: 1/2 oz each: 151, coconut rum, dark rum, coffee liqueur, 4 oz pineapple juice, juice of 1/2 fresh lemon.",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-27T20:22:37.913Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
