            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nancy Lindquist Liedel"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The coffee liquor gave it an odd, \"Off taste.\" I've never seen them made this way, but I had some Kaluha and decided to try it. I wish I'd not. I could not even finish it. Skip the coffee flavor for a more authentic taste.",
